18:48.030 --> 18:49.370
<i>Deer crackers?</i>

18:50.430 --> 18:54.360
Deer crackers...? 
Um... You mean the ones that deer eat?

18:55.950 --> 19:00.610
Er, uh... Um, well...

19:02.750 --> 19:03.740
I...

19:05.740 --> 19:07.440
I...

19:08.620 --> 19:11.120
I... cannot fulfill that order.

19:11.460 --> 19:12.880
I see.

19:12.880 --> 19:14.630
I'm terribly sorry.

19:14.630 --> 19:16.500
