and some light-roast coffee.

19:20.300 --> 19:22.430
Yes... Coming right up.

19:25.690 --> 19:28.130
<i>Why the hell would I have deer crackers?!</i>

19:28.130 --> 19:30.270
<i>Why are there deer in Hino anyway?!</i>

19:30.900 --> 19:34.020
<i>That's right! Deer are in right now! In Hino!</i>

19:34.350 --> 19:38.110
<i>At this rate, it'll all be over before 
I can give her the perfect hospitality.</i>

19:38.110 --> 19:41.280
<i>How can I even be hospitable to deer?!</i>

19:41.560 --> 19:42.280
<i>No.</i>

19:42.530 --> 19:44.780
<i>Calm down, Tsubameya Yoshiharu.</i>

19:44.780 --> 19:46.970
<i>Calm down and think clearly.</i>

19:48.320 --> 19:51.310
<i>She may be a deer, but this customer 
is still a high school girl.</i>

19:51.310 --> 19:53.400
<i>She should still be a sucker for cute things.</i>

19:53.400 --> 19:55.840
<i>And the best answer given that is...</i>

19:56.670 --> 19:57.810
<i>This!</i>

20:01.210 --> 20:02.610
Thank you for waiting.

20:02.610 --> 20:05.740
Here's your strawberry parfait, 
pancakes, and light-roast coffee.

20:05.740 --> 20:07.580
Wow, it's so cute!

20:07.580 --> 20:09.060
Thank you very much.

20:09.320 --> 20:11.100
<i>You bet it is!</i>

20:11.100 --> 20:13.870
<i>Now the deer high school girl's 
definitely going to be happy!</i>

20:13.870 --> 20:15.310
Postworthy!

20:15.940 --> 20:17.860
If you'd like, I can take a pic—

20:20.740 --> 20:22.240
I'm just gonna dig right in.

20:24.200 --> 20:26.450
<i>But why?!</i>

20:28.930 --> 20:30.950
Thanks for the food!

20:31.780 --> 20:36.090
The pancakes and the coffee... 
will be 2,000 yen.

20:36.090 --> 20:36.960
