20:37.320 --> 20:41.980
The strawberry parfait... will be 1,500 yen.

20:41.980 --> 20:44.590
He seems way older than when we first got here.

20:44.590 --> 20:51.470
<i>In the end... I was not able to give the deer 
high school girl the perfect hospitality.</i>

20:53.630 --> 20:56.860
<i>I'm not fit to run this café.</i>

20:56.860 --> 20:59.530
I think you're trying too hard.

20:59.860 --> 21:00.860
Huh?

21:01.320 --> 21:04.110
Relax your shoulders a bit.

21:04.410 --> 21:06.880
