21:07.660 --> 21:10.590
if you can sincerely face the deer 
that's right in front of you,

21:10.590 --> 21:13.370
isn't that, in itself, the perfect hospitality?

21:15.440 --> 21:17.580
Those are just the mere 
ramblings of a deer, though.

21:18.210 --> 21:19.720
Thank you for the meal.

21:22.670 --> 21:24.390
<i>She's right.</i>

21:24.760 --> 21:28.900
<i>Just because she's a high school girl, 
I tried to force J-pop and cute things onto her</i>

21:28.900 --> 21:32.200
<i>instead of offering her </i>true<i> hospitality.</i>

21:33.260 --> 21:35.140
<i>I can't let it end this way!</i>

21:36.510 --> 21:37.400
Please wait!

21:37.960 --> 21:38.760
Huh?

21:40.090 --> 21:44.850
Next time... I'll prepare the most 
exquisite deer crackers for you...

21:44.850 --> 21:47.080
so I'll be waiting for your return.

21:49.180 --> 21:50.910
I look forward to it.

21:53.690 --> 21:55.790
<i>What's with this weird vibe?</i>

21:56.690 --> 22:01.600
<i>Koshitan, having no idea how to react to either 
of the two moods she was caught between,</i>

22:01.600 --> 22:03.980
<i>decided to ignore them both.</i>
